  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Go-For Expanding space for youth&apos;s political participation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Go-For Ut&#xf6;ka utrymmet f&#xf6;r ungdomars politiska deltagande</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att ut&#xf6;ka utrymmet f&#xf6;r politiska ungdomars deltagande i
beslutsprocesser i Turkiet. Projektet kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras av GoFor i samarbete med LSU of Sweden.

Projektet syftar till att l&#xf6;sa tv&#xe5; utvecklingsutmaningar; Avsaknaden av en strukturerad mekanism f&#xf6;r politiskt deltagande f&#xf6;r ungdomar och icke-inkluderande metoder som hindrar unga m&#xe4;nniskor fr&#xe5;n att delta. 

Att ta itu med dessa fr&#xe5;gor syftar till att &#xf6;ka efterfr&#xe5;gan p&#xe5; ungdomars deltagande,
f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra deltagandemekanismer och f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra beslutsfattares attityder inkludera ungdomar p&#xe5; l&#xe5;ng sikt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects goal is to expand the space for political youth participation in decision&#xad; making processes in T&#xfc;rkiye. The project will be implemented by GoFor in partnership with LSU of Sweden. The project aims to address two problems: the absence of a structured mechanism for youth political participation and non-inclusive practices that prevent young people from participating. Whereby addressing these issues aims to increase the demand of youth participation, transform participation mechanisms, and change decision&#xad;makers&apos; attitudes towards including young people in the long term.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects goal is to expand the space for political youth participation in decision making processes in T&#xfc;rkiye. The project will be implemented by GoFor
in partnership with LSU of Sweden. The project aims to address two problems: the absence of a structured mechanism for youth political participation and non-inclusive practices that prevent young people from participating. Whereby addressing these issues aims to increase the demand of youth participation, transform participation mechanisms, and change decisionmakers&apos; attitudes towards including young people in the long term.
The project has identified two main objectives:
to strengthen the capacities of youth organizations to increase youth participation in decisionmaking processes
to develop relationships with local decisionmakers to mainstream youth rights at the local level</narrative>
  </description>
